---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import EPaperImageConverter from '../../../components/EPaperImageConverter.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['en','zh'].map(lang=>({params:{lang}}));}
const lang=Astro.params.lang==='zh'?'zh':'en';
// Both language routes intentionally share the same English tool content.
const zh=false;
---
<Base lang={lang}
  title={zh?'电子纸图像转换器：四色、六色与八色抖动':'E-Paper Image Converter — 4, 6 & 8 Colors'}
  description={zh?'免费在线电子纸图片转换工具：支持四色 BWRY、六色 Spectra 6 参考色和可自定义前需校验的八色参考调色板。浏览器本地处理，导出 PNG、8-bit/4-bit 调色板索引点阵。':'Free browser-based e-paper image converter with 4-, 6- and illustrative 8-color palettes, CIE Lab matching, measured palette JSON profiles, edge-aware text protection, PNG preview and indexed raw export. No image uploads.'}
  translations={{en:'/en/tools/epaper-image-converter/',zh:'/zh/tools/epaper-image-converter/'}}
  activeCategory="tools">
  <section lang="en" class="epc-page" data-pagefind-body>
    <p class="eyebrow">EMBEDDEDNOTE / {zh?'工程工具':'ENGINEERING TOOLS'} / E-PAPER</p>
    <h1>{zh?'电子纸图像转换器':'E-Paper Image Converter'}</h1>
    <p class="epc-lead">{zh?'将 JPG、PNG 或 WebP 转换为有限调色板的电子纸预览图与像素索引。支持四色、六色和示例八色；文件不上传。':'Turn JPG, PNG or WebP photos into limited-palette e-paper previews and indexed pixel data. Choose four, six or illustrative eight colors. Files stay on your device.'}</p>
    <p class="epc-caution">{zh?'工程说明：不同厂商的四色/八色像素颜色及控制器编码并不统一。八色模式是示例调色板，并非任何 E Ink E6 产品的认证配置。':'Engineering note: 4- and 8-color panels do not share a universal palette or wire format. The eight-color option is illustrative, not a certified E Ink E6 profile.'}</p>
    <EPaperImageConverter lang="en"/>
    <article class="epc-article prose">
      <h2>{zh?'算法与数据格式':'Algorithm and export format'}</h2>
      <p>{zh?'先按目标尺寸缩放或裁切原图，再做基础亮度、对比度与饱和度调整，最后通过调色板最近邻、Floyd–Steinberg、Atkinson 或 Bayer 4×4 进行颜色量化。算法在专用 Web Worker 中执行，减少主线程卡顿。':'The image is resized or cropped, adjusted for brightness, contrast and saturation, then quantized using nearest-color, Floyd–Steinberg, Atkinson or Bayer 4×4 dithering. Quantization runs in a dedicated Web Worker to keep the page responsive.'}</p>
      <p>{zh?'PNG 中只包含所选参考调色板的 RGB 颜色。RAW8 每像素 1 字节索引；RAW4 每字节两个索引，首像素位于高 4 位，按行从左到右、从上到下连续排列。未附加控制器要求的行对齐、像素方向和颜色代码。':'PNG uses exact reference RGB values. RAW8 stores one palette index per pixel; RAW4 packs two zero-based indices per byte, first pixel in the high nibble, row-major without row padding. Neither RAW file incorporates device-specific index mappings, row alignment, orientation or driver commands.'}</p>
      <h2>{zh?'实测面板配置与边缘保护':'Measured device profiles and edge protection'}</h2>
      <p>{zh?'v1.1 支持在本地导入含原生色号与实测 sRGB 颜色的面板 JSON 配置，使用 CIE Lab（ΔE76）量化并保护接近中性黑白的高对比度文字边缘。测量数据应记录光源与设备条件。ΔE76 为速度与精度的折中，不等于 CIEDE2000。':'v1.1 accepts local JSON profiles that separate native device color codes from measured sRGB appearance. Quantization offers CIE Lab (ΔE76), with optional protection for neutral high-contrast text edges. Document measurement lighting and equipment. ΔE76 is a speed/quality trade-off, not CIEDE2000.'}</p>
      <h2>{zh?'预览与实际屏幕颜色':'Preview versus physical color'}</h2>
      <p>{zh?'参考 RGB 调色板只是软件输出颜色，不等于反射式显示屏的实测色彩表现。不同面板、驱动波形、温度和光照都会影响实际颜色。正式产品应使用经校准的调色板和与硬件一致的编码映射。':'RGB reference swatches do not reproduce measured reflective panel colors. Real appearance depends on panel, waveform, temperature and lighting. Hardware releases need measured color calibration and an explicit device encoding map.'}</p>
      <h2>{zh?'参考项目与技术资料':'References and further reading'}</h2>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/paperlesspaper/epdoptimize" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EPD Optimize</a> · <a href="https://github.com/redphx/dithr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DITHR</a> · <a href="https://www.eink.com/tech/detail/How_it_works" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">E Ink technology overview</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
.epc-page{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,44px) 0 70px}.epc-page h1{font:700 clamp(33px,4.4vw,55px)/1.12 Georgia,'Noto Serif SC',serif;color:#17211e;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:12px 0 20px}.epc-lead{font:clamp(15px,1.55vw,18px)/1.75 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#59645e;max-width:950px}.epc-caution{border-left:3px solid #b94530;padding:10px 16px;background:#f8f3ea;color:#5b5144;font:13px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif}.epc-article{max-width:900px;border-top:1px solid #d0c8bb;padding-top:24px}.epc-article h2{font-family:Georgia,'Noto Serif SC',serif}
</style>
